    "text": "Knoxville\nHow a marble collection brought light to one woman's darkest days\n1 hours ago\nKNOXVILLE, Tenn. — Sometimes it’s the little things that bring us the most joy. For Katie Erwin, those little things are marbles. What started as a simple hobby has grown into something much more. For Katie and her family, the collection represents therapy, community, and above all, hope.",
